{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12803","headline":"赠别王侍御赴上都 · 韩翃","name":"赠别王侍御赴上都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩马上郎，执简佩银章。\n西向洛阳归鄠杜，回头结念莲花府。\n朝辞芳草万岁街，暮宿春山一泉坞。\n青青树色傍行衣，乳燕流莺相间飞。\n远过三峯临八水，幽寻佳赏偏如此。\n残花片片细柳风，落日疎钟小槐雨。\n相思掩泣复何如，公子门前人渐疎。\n幸有心期当小暑，葛衣纱帽望回车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}